From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] warp: optimize TX hotpath, fix tailroom FOE macros, and unwind RRO 3.1

Short-circuit wifi_dump_skb() when debug level is below WARP_DBG_WAR and
guard header dereferences with skb_header_pointer(), validate headroom
and tailroom bounds before accessing FOE_AI()/FOE_AI_TAIL() and use
_TAIL PAO macros inside the tailroom branch, and invoke
warp_rx_rro_3_1_exit_hw() during exit and SER reset when RRO 3.1 is
supported.

Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/warp_platform/warp_mtk.c
+++ b/warp_platform/warp_mtk.c
@@ -44,8 +44,13 @@
 	struct wlan_tx_info *info,
 	struct sk_buff *skb)
 {
-	struct iphdr *ip_h = ip_hdr(skb);
-	struct ethhdr *eth_h = eth_hdr(skb);
+	struct ethhdr _eth, *eth_h;
+	struct iphdr _iph, *ip_h;
+	int nh_off;
+
+	/* Fast exit when debug level is below WARP_DBG_WAR. */
+	if (likely(warp_log_get() < WARP_DBG_WAR))
+		return;
 
 	warp_dbg(WARP_DBG_WAR,
 		 "%s(): add entry: wdma=%d,ringId=%d,wcid=%d,bssid=%d\n",
@@ -55,49 +60,46 @@
